{"id":"c3aa8c36416a1ebf","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Pcf Rank Invariant Code","display":"df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code — ZFC Comb8 Pcf Rank Invariant Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code — ZFC Comb8 Pcf Rank Invariant Code","depends_on":["[[58-df-ideal]]","[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-pcf-rank-invariant-code — ZFC Comb8 Pcf Rank Invariant Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,A,J,f,g,h,R\\in V\">\\(r,A,J,f,g,h,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal.md\">58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModIdealLess}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModIdealLess}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfRankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfRankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8PcfRankInvariantCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8PcfRankInvariantCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}rank\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}code} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModIdealLess}_S(g,h,A,J)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow g,h\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)\\geq h(a)\\}\\in J,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PcfRankFunction}_S(R,A,J)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(R,\\prod_{a\\in A}a,V\\right)\\land\n\\forall h\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(R(h))\\land\nR(h)=\\sup\\{R(g)+1:g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\mathrm{ModIdealLess}_S(g,h,A,J)\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8PcfRankInvariantCode}_S(r,A,J,f)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(a)\\land |A|&lt;\\min A\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land f\\in\\prod A\\land\n\\exists R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PcfRankFunction}_S(R,A,J)\\land\nr=\\langle A,J,f,R(f)\\rangle\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}rank\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}code} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModIdealLess}_S(g,h,A,J)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow g,h\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)\\geq h(a)\\}\\in J,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PcfRankFunction}_S(R,A,J)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(R,\\prod_{a\\in A}a,V\\right)\\land\n\\forall h\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(R(h))\\land\nR(h)=\\sup\\{R(g)+1:g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\mathrm{ModIdealLess}_S(g,h,A,J)\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8PcfRankInvariantCode}_S(r,A,J,f)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(a)\\land |A|&lt;\\min A\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land f\\in\\prod A\\land\n\\exists R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PcfRankFunction}_S(R,A,J)\\land\nr=\\langle A,J,f,R(f)\\rangle\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The code is admitted only when its constituents form legitimate progressive PCF data and a rank function satisfying the full predecessor-supremum recursion exists; no primitive, undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}_J\">\\(\\operatorname{rk}_J\\)</span> selector remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-idea